// door; a person trapped to the thighs in the debris beside the road; a resident lying injured on the
// intact end of B02's roof; and a person who walked down onto the debris. Buried out of sight: one in
// the crushed orchard shed B05 and the driver of the sedan (V07) the debris caught on the road. A red
// backpack and a red tarp from the shed lie on the debris.
